    "messages": [
      {
        "user": "NW1118",
        "user_name": "James Carter",
        "ts": "2026-02-03T14:05:00+00:00",
        "text": "Call with Mark Lewis (Brightmart VM) done. They have a competing bid roughly 20% under our 12% draft number. He was explicit: 12% won't get through their procurement board."
      },
      {
        "user": "NW1101",
        "user_name": "Siddharth Chauhan",
        "ts": "2026-02-03T19:50:00+05:30",
        "text": "Then 12% is dead. Manoj, can we model 18% with a renewal reprice? Anything >15% goes to CFO+CEO."
      },
      {
        "user": "NW0202",
        "user_name": "Manoj Pillai",
        "ts": "2026-02-03T20:15:00+05:30",
        "text": "Modelled: 18% gives ~21% floor margin vs 28% target. Needs Pricing Committee note. Booking committee for Thu 5 Feb."
      },
      {
        "user": "NW0011",
        "user_name": "Rahul Bhatia",
        "ts": "2026-02-03T20:40:00+05:30",
        "text": "Agree. Strategic UK logo; I'll recommend at committee."
      }
    ]
  },
