        "user_name": "Ishaan Malhotra",
        "ts": "2026-02-11T12:10:00+05:30",
        "text": "Accepting both: DPA §8 (24h) and §11 / MSA §7.3 (office-only from ODC-2). Flagging to Siddharth for team planning."
